OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny mist patches quickly
OL,6,Fclearing this morning to leave a dry
OL,7,Fand sunny morning. A little fair
OL,8,Fweather cloud will bubble up this
OL,9,Fafternoon, but still plenty of warm
OL,10,Fsunny spells.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FStaying dry tonight with
OL,13,Fclear skies. A few mist patches are
OL,14,Fpossible in places, and feeling cool
OL,15,Foutside of towns and cities.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FA dry day on Sunday and
OL,18,Ffeeling hot in the sunny spells. Some
OL,19,Fpatchy cloud developing in the
OL,20,Fafternoon, but still plenty of
OL,21,Fsunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
