OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FTurning very warm and humid from
OL,7,FMonday with an increasing chance of
OL,8,Fshowers. Feeling very hot in the sunny
OL,9,Fspells, particularly on Monday. A
OL,10,Fsmall risk of thunderstorms at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
